whatslab.retarget.dex.optimizer is derived from dex-retargeting 0.5.0
(https://github.com/dexsuite/dex-retargeting): the DexPilot and vector objectives
(dex_retargeting/optimizer.py), the pinocchio robot wrapper (robot_wrapper.py), the
mimic-joint kinematics adaptor (kinematics_adaptor.py) and the sequential solve with its
low-pass filter (seq_retarget.py, optimizer_utils.py, folded into engine.py). The torch
autograd losses were rewritten in numpy. dex-retargeting is distributed under the
